<span id="A3.T7.6.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">released in the United States on September 23, 2003.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.6.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T7.6.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_th ltx_th_row"></th>
<td id="A3.T7.6.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T7.6.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;">
<span id="A3.T7.6.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">after moving into Pizza Hut Park in 2005.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A3.T7.6.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A3.T7.6.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:99.6pt;--ltx-bg-color:#EBEBEB;">
<span id="A3.T7.6.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">after moving to the Emirates Stadium in 2005.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T7.6.4" class="ltx_tr">
